{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you don't have to do anything. It just sets your free to explore a changing winter landscape from a cabin deep in the woods. Your trails remain - no matter how far you go... and you can see them from a birds-eye view. Find good places to draw in the snow! ...Before you know it, time has passed and the snow turns to sparkly gold by the setting sun... It is a game for people who want to spend time in beautiful environments and play at their own pace.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find beautiful vistas and walk wherever you feel like. No place looks quite the same when the day passes to dusk and night, and weather comes and goes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk on ice, crack ice, travel on ice.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make tracks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way home again using your tracks. Or draw things with them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relax</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In winter the land is resting - and so can you. Take walks in this open world and get lost. Be surprised by the richness of sounds in nature. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909310/extras/8a1052b2a0bd756b7555c8eed50a0c68.poster.avif?t=1768735802\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909310/extras/8a1052b2a0bd756b7555c8eed50a0c68.webm?t=1768735802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909310/extras/8a1052b2a0bd756b7555c8eed50a0c68.mp4?t=1768735802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1909310?t=1768735802","